      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Display position? I think part of the idea of a fallbacks is that you can see where someone's eyes and hands are at even if you're not seeing the avatar.\n\nI think there is possibility to shrink the parts to be more skinny but I think height should remain accurate. \n\nTldr: I don't want to have a conversation about staring at someone's tits if I'm looking a robot in the eyes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
