      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "honestly at this point i would prefer seeing an unloaded diamond than the \"blocked greybot\".. or maybe make the greybot translucent. \n\nit's not very aesthetically pelasing generally speaking. we need a new \"graybot, blocked, error\" avatar style that is a bit less obnoxious.\n\nedit:\n\nafter some thoughts. please let us choose which fallbacks other users appears in; if they don't have one on their avatars. instead of reverting to the defaults ones.\n\ni could describe something more elaborate of a system that works if this actually gets tractions, it's been on my mind for a bit and i think i might have decent suggestions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
