      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} fallbacks are not the same as greybots, but i'm sure you already knew that :)\n\ni also agree with your sentiment. it can be weird and awkward to interact with people because they have not set themselves a fallback, or integrated it in their avatar... and their POV isn't where you'd expect it.... because the avatar proportions don't match and stuff. \n\nalso, the default fallbacks selections don't really help since they are very inconsistent.\n\nat minimum, i'd prefer a diamond or a generic translucent greybot. i find it more intuitive and aesthetically pleasing than some random fallbacks or a obnoxious grey-bot.",
