      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The most common reason I hide someone's avatar is because they are a giant. Which, turns them into a giant robot. A poor solution. Personally, a better alternative  would be an accessibility feature.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
