  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-01T21:28:43.241Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The size of the robot avatar that is displayed in place of the individual avatar that is hidden by the safety feature is too large. When there is a robot avatar in front of a group of people in a multi-person event, the view is obstructed and transparency is not possible, making it more of a distraction.\n\nPlease make it narrower in depth and width and shorter in height. Also, please lower the display position.",
